#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:563
msgid "ML library *(behavior)*"
msgstr "机器学习库 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:565
msgid "Same API, different numbers — re-check any tuned ML pipeline."
msgstr "API 相同，数值不同—— 请重新检查任何已调优的机器学习流程。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:567
msgid "**Preprocessing now stretches instead of letterboxes**"
msgstr "**预处理现在改为拉伸而非加黑边**"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:569
msgid ""
":class:`~ml.preprocessing.Normalization` now uses "
":data:`image.SCALE_ASPECT_IGNORE` (stretch) instead of "
":data:`image.SCALE_ASPECT_EXPAND` (letterbox). :class:`~ml.utils.NMS` post-"
"processing also switched to independent x/y scaling."
msgstr ""
":class:`~ml.preprocessing.Normalization` 现在使用 "
":data:`image.SCALE_ASPECT_IGNORE`\\ （拉伸）而非 "
":data:`image.SCALE_ASPECT_EXPAND`\\ （加黑边）。\\ :class:`~ml.utils.NMS` "
"后处理也改为独立的 x/y 缩放。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:576
msgid ""
"**Impact.** YOLO-style detectors and keypoint regressors generally improve. "
"The :class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.BlazeFace`, "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.BlazePalm`, "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.FaceLandmarks`, and "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.HandLandmarks` examples now require a "
"manual square crop on the input ROI — the example scripts were updated; "
"custom user code must do the same."
msgstr ""
"**影响。** YOLO 风格的检测器和关键点回归器通常会有所改善。\\ "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.BlazeFace`\\ 、\\ "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.BlazePalm`\\ 、\\ "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.FaceLandmarks` 和 "
":class:`~ml.postprocessing.mediapipe.HandLandmarks` 示例现在需要对输入 ROI 进行手动方形裁剪——"
" 示例脚本已更新；自定义用户代码也必须照做。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:584
msgid ""
"*Commit:* `68dc29a33 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/68dc29a33>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `68dc29a33 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/68dc29a33>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:586
msgid "**ml.utils.mod() helper removed**"
msgstr "**ml.utils.mod() 辅助函数已移除**"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:588
msgid ""
"ulab 6.12.0 supports ``%`` on ndarrays natively. Code that imported ``mod`` "
"from ``ml.utils`` must use ``a % b``."
msgstr ""
"ulab 6.12.0 原生支持在 ndarray 上使用 ``%``\\ 。从 ``ml.utils`` 导入 ``mod`` 的代码必须改用 ``a"
" % b``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:591
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `35ece5728 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/35ece5728>`__, `82fbd858c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/82fbd858c>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `35ece5728 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/35ece5728>`__\\ "
"、\\ `82fbd858c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/82fbd858c>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:597
msgid "Build / tooling *(tooling)*"
msgstr "构建/工具链 *(tooling)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:599
msgid ""
"None of this affects MicroPython scripts. Building firmware from source now "
"requires the external **OpenMV SDK** (1.6.0, previously in-tree). Several "
"in-tree build tools were removed and the N6 moved to the TinyUSB stack; "
"downstream forks should review the `firmware repository "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__ history — notably the ``file_open()`` "
"signature dropping its ``buffered`` argument."
msgstr ""
"这些都不会影响 MicroPython 脚本。现在从源码构建固件需要外部 **OpenMV SDK**\\ "
"（1.6.0，此前在源码树内）。若干源码树内的构建工具已被移除，N6 已迁移到 TinyUSB 协议栈；下游分支应查阅 `固件仓库 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__ 的历史记录—— 尤其是 ``file_open()`` 签名去掉了其 "
"``buffered`` 参数。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:609
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "迁移检查清单"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:611
msgid "For a clean port to v5.0.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "要干净地移植到 v5.0.0，典型的工作是："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:613
msgid ""
"Replace ``import sensor`` with ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` and "
"translate every ``set_*``/``get_*`` call to its :class:`csi.CSI` accessor "
"(:ref:`the csi migration <v5_0_0_s1>`)."
msgstr ""
"将 ``import sensor`` 替换为 ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()``\\ ，并将每个 "
"``set_*``/``get_*`` 调用转换为其对应的 :class:`csi.CSI` 访问器（\\ :ref:`csi 迁移 "
"<v5_0_0_s1>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:616
msgid ""
"Wrap coordinate arguments to ``img.draw_*``, :meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel`,"
" and :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` in tuples (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"将传给 ``img.draw_*``\\ 、\\ :meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel` 和 "
":meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` 的坐标参数包装进元组（\\ :ref:`image 模块变更 <v5_0_0_s2>`\\"
" ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:619
msgid ""
"Drop ``()`` from attrtuple result accessors if you want the new idiomatic "
"form, or leave the old style alone since attrtuples still support callable "
"accessors (:ref:`the image module changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"如果你想采用新的惯用形式，请从 attrtuple 结果访问器中去掉 ``()``\\ ；或者保持旧风格不变，因为 attrtuple "
"仍然支持可调用的访问器（\\ :ref:`image 模块变更 <v5_0_0_s2>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:622
msgid ""
"Audit :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression`, and any "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags` family choice (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"审查 :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`\\ 、\\ "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression` 以及任何 :meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags`"
" 族的选择（\\ :ref:`image 模块变更 <v5_0_0_s2>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:626
msgid ""
"Rename ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` in :func:`protocol.init` calls; remove "
"``protocol.poll()`` and ``soft_reboot=`` (:ref:`the protocol module changes "
"<v5_0_0_s4>`)."
msgstr ""
"在 :func:`protocol.init` 调用中将 ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` 重命名；移除 "
"``protocol.poll()`` 和 ``soft_reboot=``\\ （\\ :ref:`protocol 模块变更 "
"<v5_0_0_s4>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:629
msgid ""
"For ML workflows: revisit any model that needed letterboxed input (:ref:`the"
" ML library changes <v5_0_0_s6>`)."
msgstr "对于机器学习工作流：重新审视任何需要加黑边输入的模型（\\ :ref:`机器学习库变更 <v5_0_0_s6>`\\ ）。"
